\newlabel{sub@fig:gss_synth}{{a}{34}{Synthetic dataset (top 10 features by mean $\Delta M_{\text {disc}}$). The Asymmetric row is near-zero; Causal and Flow concentrate their PC-vs-LiNGAM magnitude differences on X33 and X47, with Flow producing the single darkest cell on X33}{figure.caption.28}{}}
